<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερέω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερῶ</span></b> , serving as
		fut. of aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεῖπον</span>: pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατείρηκα</span>: —<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speak against, accuse</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὸς πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					595b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὸς ἐναντίον τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Thg.</u>
					125a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>denounce</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.71
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερῶ Ἀθηναίοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.39.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>declare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθεν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Pae.</u>
				6.129
			</span></i>; <i>tell plainly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐν τῷ κεῖται χώρῳ ἡ παρακαταθήκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.92
				</span></i>
			.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή; κατερῶ πρὸς ὑμᾶς ἐλευθέρως
					τἀληθῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					518
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1106
			</span></i>(anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοὔνομ᾽ ὅ τι ποτ᾽ ἐστί σοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					189
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειρήσεται</span>
			<i>shall be declared</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.69
			</span></i>.</div>
